Fantasy Backpack Native Unity Prefab

Import this package with Assets > Import Package > Custom Package.
After scripts compile, the package automatically creates:
Assets/FantasyBackpack/FantasyBackpack.prefab

No GLB importer is required. Drag the prefab into a scene.
The Animation component contains the OpenLid clip.
Play it with: GetComponent<Animation>().Play("OpenLid");

To regenerate manually use Tools > Fantasy Backpack > Rebuild Prefab.
